            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Cam Chi",
            "review_text": "mvanroy\nMerelbeke, Belgium883 contributions\n0\nGood street food in a lively neighbourhood\nJul 2026 • Family\nDifficult to choose a restaurant in this nice street food neighbourhood, but we made a good choice with Bun Cha Cam Chi. Friendly service, good English. Nice atmosphere, comfy plastic chairs. We wanted a light dinner and ordered a few fresh spring rolls (very fresh and very good!) and the dumpling soup (enough meat and dumplings, good broth). Big plus: Hanoi beers are served in a bottle, not in a can! Excellent price / quality.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 18, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
